-tight text-ink">Track Record</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">3+</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">University &amp; Institutional Projects — Full Lifecycle</p></div><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">5+</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Regulatory Bodies Navigated — AICTE, UGC, NSDC, SSC &amp; State</p></div><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">8+</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Years of Institutional Setup &amp; Skill Development Experience</p></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">University &amp; Institution Setup</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-displa